## 129. Intersection Formula Chart

Maximum intersections of \(n\) general-position lines:

```text
{n\choose2}
```

| Lines | Intersections |
|---:|---:|
| 2 | 1 |
| 3 | 3 |
| 4 | 6 |
| 5 | 10 |
| 6 | 15 |
| 7 | 21 |
| 8 | 28 |
| 9 | 36 |
| 10 | 45 |

---

## 130. Region Formula Chart

Maximum regions from \(n\) lines:

```text
\frac{n(n+1)}2+1
```

| Lines | Regions |
|---:|---:|
| 1 | 2 |
| 2 | 4 |
| 3 | 7 |
| 4 | 11 |
| 5 | 16 |
| 6 | 22 |
| 7 | 29 |
| 8 | 37 |

